WEBVTT

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.470
Noel?!

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.040
Noel!

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.320
Nonoka...

00:00:21.770 --> 00:02:08.230
Noel!

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:10.970
Nonoka...

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:12.230
Noel?

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:16.390
Why...

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:20.780
<i>So if she's far away, bad things will happen.</i>

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.740
You told me that everything was okay!

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.280
I'm... sorry...

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.220
Tell me,

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:29.460
what should I do?

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.790
What should I do to help you?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.420
Take me to where I can see the Disc...

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.090
The Disc?

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:36.730
<i>What happened?</i>

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:37.480
We just need to get back to the town?

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.930
<i>Is Noel-chan with you?</i>

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:39.680
<i>What about the Disc?!</i>

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.800
Sorry, Koharu. I'll fill you in later.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.260
Hang in there, Noel.

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:50.100
Hey... Nonoka...

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.930
Dad?

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:51.690
You drove to work today, right?

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.580
Nonoka...

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.060
Please help me!

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:55.800
Don't worry, everything will be—

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.070
Where's... Shione?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:06.580
Noel?

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:09.580
Noel!

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:18.860
Any luck on your end?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.620
No, I can't find her!

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.680
Maybe she's not at school.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.430
What do we do?!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.290
If I hadn't been so careless, she—

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:29.170
Souta!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.210
Don't look so glum.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.450
For all we know, she might've just went home without us.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.940
Right. That must be it!

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.940
Y-Yeah.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.280
<i>I can't see the Disc if I'm that far away.</i>

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.150
<i>What?</i>

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.990
<i>Wouldn't that mean you can't go farther than the edge of town?</i>

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:49.020
She's okay. I know it.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.790
She found Noel-chan!

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.010
See?

00:03:59.020 --> 00:03:59.800
But...

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.550
I felt like something was off over the phone...

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.550
Everything will be okay.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.300
It's not much further, so hang in there, Noel.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.560
Are you sure that she just needs to be back in town?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.590
Yes!

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.640
Nonoka?

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.880
How's Noel-chan?

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.150
Yeah.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.790
Okay.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.590
So she's going to be all right?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.390
Where are you right now?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:54.930
Noel.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:03.820
You were watching over me to help my wish come true, weren't you?

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:11.950
"I wish my friends and I would always be happy together."

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:25.630
Without you, I wouldn't have remembered this wish that's so dear to me.

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:34.420
Thank you, Noel.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.630
Coming!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.950
You should have these with Noel-chan.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.360
These are from me.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.780
This will make her better!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.350
Thanks!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.290
We were so worried when you told us she fainted.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.430
Quit making trouble for us, Shorty.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:06.550
Thank goodness.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.060
Hey—

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:20.460
Nonoka, we'll leave Noel in your care.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:24.070
To be honest, I would have liked to stay with her all night, but...

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:30.460
Also, I'm sure Shione really wanted to go to the Hokubi Festival!

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:32.470
Something probably just came up on her end.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:34.260
I hope so too.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:36.080
Thanks for everything today.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.260
Thank you, everyone.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:38.900
Nonoka,

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.080
what happened to Noel-chan?

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.590
Wasn't she just tired from the festival?

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.440
I've been wondering about her too.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.630
Souta?

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.590
If there's anything you know...

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:58.370
Noel can't leave the town.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.980
That's the reason she fainted.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.510
What do you mean?

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.860
The Disc that we called seven years ago—

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.110
that's Noel.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:16.790
Mr. Disc, Mr. Disc!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.040
Please!

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:18.960
Please, grant my...

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:19.740
And mine...

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:20.750
Please,

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.900
grant our wishes!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.000
Noel's the Disc?

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.050
She tried to grant our wishes from back then?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:29.640
Yeah.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:30.690
Hang on, now!

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:36.010
How can you two calmly take what she just said in stride?!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.530
There's no way that thing is Noel!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:42.520
I mean, she helped me with all those Disc protests...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.710
Noel was happy that she could help you when you needed it.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.530
You're her friend, after all.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.280
I'm sure Noel would say something like that.

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:57.480
I see...

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.650
Of course.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:02.170
Noel's the Disc, who's also our friend.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.790
That means nothing's really changed!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.380
Yup.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:28.710
It's fluffy...

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.250
It's cool!

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.570
Noel?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.530
Noel!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.160
Good morning, Nonoka!

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.450
Noel!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.000
Wh-What's wrong, Nonoka?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.420
What do you mean, "what's wrong?"

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:47.910
I was so worried about you!

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:49.010
We all were!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.060
Huh? Worried?

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:55.980
Nonoka, what about Shione?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.170
Were the two of you happy together?

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.080
Let's not think about that right now.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.130
It didn't work out?

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.860
Nonoka, Noel's sorry.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:23.240
There's nothing you need to apologize for.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:30.590
Wait.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:35.720
I...

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:40.350
Be happy together with Shione again!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.230
Why?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:55.240
You and Shione became friends again!

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:58.830
That's what I thought too, but...

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.470
It's true!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:06.000
When Noel talked with Shione, she said that she wanted to be happy with you!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.250
What didn't she like about Noel?

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:12.190
When she ate omelet rice with her?

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:14.250
When she jumped into the hot spring?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.070
When she sent her message for her?

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:18.010
When she received her ticket?

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:22.010
Or that after she grants her wish, Noel will disappear?

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:11.620
Morning!

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:13.980
Good morning, Yuzuki.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.210
You look pretty down.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.990
Wait, did something happen to Noel?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.650
No, it's nothing like that.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:23.420
Well, if you say so.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:27.280
But don't keep any secrets about Noel from us, okay?

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.330
All right.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.500
Nonoka!

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.970
Here's the telescope—

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:33.420
Whoa, there.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.280
Are you okay?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:42.760
Yes. Thank you, Souta.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.550
You too, Yuzuki.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.040
Jeez, you startled me.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:50.570
I brought some buns!

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.030
Whoa, there.

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:55.480
Koharu, are you okay?

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.010
Yes. Thank you, Souta.

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.180
What about me?

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.790
Y-You too, Yuzuki.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.290
Great, everyone's here!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.890
I want you all to meet someone.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:11.070
Nice to meet you.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.670
I'm Togawa Shione.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:20.180
Shione is my dear...

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.520
...friend.

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:51.210
Excuse me!

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:54.290
Um, I just wanted to ask you about Togawa-san—

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.460
Oh, about her transfer?

00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:59.630
Transfer?

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.970
Sorry, was it something else?

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.140
No, it's okay. Nevermind.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.400
Nonoka! Hurry up and go!

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:13.070
Shione's your dear friend, isn't she?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:17.220
I'll take the telescope home with me, so make sure you stop by later to pick it up!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:19.910
Don't worry, I won't let her carry it.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:23.910
Thanks, guys!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:39.840
Shione!

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:43.120
Please, just let me talk to you!

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.630
I don't want things between us to end this way!

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.310
Noel told me something.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.730
Once she grants us our wishes, she'll...

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:58.860
Shione...

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.870
Is it true that you're moving?

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.620
I'm just going to go live with my father.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.120
Is that because of Noel?

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:12.380
It is, isn't it?

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:15.370
Why does it matter to you?

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:24.760
"I wish my friends and I would always be happy together."

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:29.740
I love all of you!

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.890
I don't want to lose anyone ever again.

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:37.530
That's why we should think this through together!

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:38.750
Stop that.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.450
What is there to even think about?

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:45.200
I'm not as attached to the observatory as the rest of you.

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:47.450
I only went there because I was invited to come along.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:52.410
I don't see a problem with leaving if it means Noel will stay.

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.690
Are you really okay with that?

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:58.620
Go home.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.940
Of course I'm not...

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:09.580
I love everyone too.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.450
What am I supposed to do?

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:18.420
Shione is my dear friend!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.940
That makes her our friend too, then!

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.080
Onii-chan, that's not fair!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.630
Count me in too!

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:26.900
Nice to meet you.

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:29.940
Me too!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:34.510
Liar.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:52.770
Nonoka!

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.060
Noel.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.400
Are you feeling better?

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.200
Yup!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.170
See?

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:02.650
Thank goodness.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:08.160
Noel wants to make Nonoka's wish come true, no matter what!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:13.830
Because you came to this town after being called by us?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.260
At first, yes.

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:17.420
"At first?"

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:20.920
When Noel met everyone, she realized something!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:26.630
Your wish was something really, really amazing!

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:32.060
Everyone was happy, and everyone was always together!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:35.820
No matter what happened, everyone felt the same way!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.310
It was really something!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.900
That's why Noel wants to see everyone smiling together again!

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:48.610
But...

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.980
But that's...

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.540
You're in my way.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.410
If you're not even going to help, just go home.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:04.450
Come on, I'm waiting for Nonoka to show up.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.880
That's all?

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.510
I want to ask her what happened with Shione.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:11.300
She's been acting really weird lately.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.310
Shione!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:23.570
Thank goodness, Shione.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.150
Noel wanted to talk to you.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:28.080
Go back to Nonoka.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:31.300
Shione?

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:37.370
Oh, I'm sorry, but I'm afraid we're—

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.340
Shione?

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:41.470
Hey! Where have you been this entire time?

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:42.970
We were worried sick!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:44.490
What happened?

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.780
Isn't Nonoka with you?

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:49.090
There's something I need to tell you.

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.090
It's about Noel.

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.190
I'd better go pick up the telescope.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.230
Mom...

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:08.500
What should I do?

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.380
Everyone happy together...

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.910
I don't want Noel to disappear.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:33.560
That's why...

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:43.940
That's why you shouldn't talk to me anymore.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.650
You know, it doesn't have to be you.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:54.400
We just need to make sure that there's always something separating the five of us.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:57.790
In which case, I can just isolate myself from the rest of you.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:18:59.910
Hold on!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.080
I've caused everyone so much trouble because of the Disc, so it should be—

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.530
I can't trust an idiot like you to keep it that way.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.370
What's that supposed to mean, jerk?!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.540
Both of you, stop fighting!

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.180
Sou... ta?

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.140
What's wrong, Yuzuki?

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.440
Hey, hold on!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.420
What happened?

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:33.450
Koharu!

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:34.640
Here.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.280
Thanks.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.580
Did Shione tell you guys?

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.640
I don't want this.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:08.690
Noel...

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:26.470
<i>That day, Noel heard everyone's voices from the clouds above the observatory.</i>

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:29.030
<i>Voices that called for the Disc.</i>

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.040
<i>Voices that called for Noel.</i>

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.340
<i>That's how Noel was able to meet everyone.</i>

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:41.470
<i>When she first met Nonoka, she knew it was her right away!</i>

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.980
<i>She was so happy.</i>

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:50.890
<i>She spent time together with Nonoka, was taught a lovely song,</i>

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:56.240
<i>and the food Nonoka cooked her was so yummy!</i>

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:03.520
<i>Yuzuki, Koharu, Souta, and Shione...</i>

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:08.040
<i>Everyone was so nice and friendly.</i>

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:13.300
<i>It made Noel really, really happy!</i>

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.260
<i>And now, she knows something for sure.</i>

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:21.300
<i>What Noel wants to see</i>

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:30.770
<i>is Nonoka, Shione, Koharu, Yuzuki, and Souta being happy together.</i>

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.570
It's because she loves everyone!

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:45.680
That's why...

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:51.480
Noel has to say goodbye.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:34.630
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:36.190
"A Night With Shooting Stars."

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:37.510
Look forward to it!
